ents. Featuring the powerful Intel® 82599ES controller and a PCI Express Gen3 x8 interface, this adapter ensures low latency, high throughput, and efficient data processing with minimal CPU load.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Quad-Port 10Gb Ethernet via SFP+ interfaces</li><li>Intel® 82599ES controller for reliable and high-performance networking</li><li>PCI Express Gen3 x8 interface for maximum data transfer speed</li><li>Low-profile design suitable for compact server installations</li><li>Supports 10GBASE-SR, 10GBASE-LR, and other SFP+ modules</li><li>Compatible with Windows and Linux operating systems</li><li>Ideal for data centers, high-performance computing, storage networking, and virtualized environments</li></ul><h3>Specifications:</h3><ul><li>Ports: 4 x SFP+</li><li>Interface: PCIe Gen3 x8</li><li>Form Factor: Low Profile</li><li>Power Consumption: Approximately 16.44W</li><li>Dimensions: 167.64mm x 85.77mm</li><li>Operating Temperature: 0°C to 45°C</li><li>Humidity: 0% to 90%, non-condensing</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                  